# Concurrent-session artifacts: shared-machine state that is not this branch's content.
# docs/proof/ holds another session's Gate-D packets (e.g. gate-p-<date>/ for a sibling
# branch); committing them from a different branch would attribute their evidence here.
docs/proof/

# Session scratch: review transcripts, gate JSON captures, screenshots, tool caches.
# `.local/` additionally holds whole-repo working copies (`.local/*/repo`) that carry
# `.signing.key` and `.serve.token` — the two secrets ignored above — so committing it
# would put them in history through a copy. 384 MB, none of it branch content.
.local/
.lavish/
.serena/

# Deviator runtime output inside the lattice skill. `runs/*.jsonl` and `runs/deviator.db`
# are tracked ledger state (0beeb46); these four directories are per-run artifacts written
# by whatever session last executed the engine, in the same class as docs/proof/ above.
capabilities/skills/rig-lattice-system/runs/approvals/
capabilities/skills/rig-lattice-system/runs/packets/
capabilities/skills/rig-lattice-system/runs/proof_packets/
capabilities/skills/rig-lattice-system/runs/log/
